#: {{ux|en|Put the key in the '''ignition''' and turn in right.}}
# {{lb|en|physics}} The phenomenon of a [[thermonuclear]] [[fusion]] reaction becoming [[self-sustaining]] and no longer requiring external [[heat]]ing.{{wikipedia|fusion ignition}}

